Scope: deterministic standard-library regression of the exact algebraic knot-jump identity on 50,000 random continuous piecewise-affine potentials, plus 10,000 monotone-slope sign trials and exact Fraction arithmetic for the peer margin/overshoot corollary. The numerical trials are sanity checks, not the proof of Theorem 2.1.
